<title>EGYPT: Egyptian pound interbank rates steady.</title>
<headline>Egyptian pound interbank rates steady.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Interbank rates on the Egyptian pound were mostly unchanged on Tuesday in an sluggish market, private bankers said.</p>
<p>They said overnight rates were steady at 10 1/4 and 10 3/8 percent. One-week rates narrowed slightly to 10 1/4 and 10 3/8 from Monday's range of 10 1/4 and 10 7/16 percent.</p>
<p>Public sector banks' rates remained unchanged at 10 1/2 percent.</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +202 578 3290/91</p>
